@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# Billing questions
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` classifies a message containing
+the exact lowercase substring `refund` as `refund-review`; every other message
+is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+For refund and invoice questions, use this classification only to distinguish
+the response category. The classifier establishes no refund decision, invoice
+state, or billing side effect. Answer from available evidence and state when a
+requested billing fact is not established.

